  "title": "Answer: no theory of life, which serves as the model of an eliminated posit",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "371cfa5f-5590-452a-9c20-4eb32ce5110f",
      "text": "The view has no theory of life. Life is its model case: the vitalist feared that without vital spirit nothing would explain what makes living things alive, and biochemistry changed that. The same may happen with mental posits.",
